I prepared a request to create a managed Turnstile widget named "demo.example signup" in account `demo`. It covers `demo.example`, `localhost` and `127.0.0.1`. The tools are dry runs, so the request was not sent. No widget exists, and I have no real sitekey or secret.

I also have no file tools in this session, so I couldn't read or edit your signup form or handler. Below is the code to add, using the placeholder `demo-sitekey`.

**Signup form:**

```html
